  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "建築設計實習",
    "sub_ename": "PRACTICE OF ARCHITECTURAL DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "經由課堂上建築設計理論的講授外，藉由此實習課程的參加，使同學實際了解建築事務所之營運，進而熟悉與了解建築設計實際的方法及應用技術。實習課程規定：1.本建築設計實習課程，每年將開設於建築學士學位學程五年級上學期必修課程，為4學分之課程。學生須於五年級上學期時選修該門課程。2.實習總成績70﹪為實習機構之評比分數，30﹪為實習報告分數。3.一經查核符合實習期滿者，則給予該門課程學分。本課程為4學分之專業必修課程，學生應於與本系專業領域相關之機關、團體、公司或事務所實際參予實務工作320小時，並經負責人或主管人員簽證評比後取得本課程之學分。",
    "describe_eh": " Except for the architectural design theory, students realize the operation of the architecture firm by the internship. Furthermore, students can understand the real method and the application technology of the architectural design.Course Registration: 1.\"Practice of Architecture Studio\" is a required course with four credits for the Department of Architecture in the first semester of the fifth year. Course registration should be completed by the student in the latter semester of the fifth year. 2.70% of the total score for internship comes from evaluations by the institutions and the other 30% is based on the internship reports. 3.Credit shall be granted after the accomplishment of internship practice is approved. This required course carrying four credits postulates that our students join the practical operation in any governmental or private institution, group, corporation, or firm with professions relevant to ours for 320 hours and obtain certification with supervisor's signature before acquiring this unit.\r\n",
